{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/blocks\/post-faq\/index.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Behaviour":[""],"Header":[""],"Text":[""],"Typography":[""],"Body":[""],"Background":[""],"Border":[""],"Padding":[""],"Copied Successfully!":[""],"Copy To Clipboard":[""],"Copy the shortcode and use it anywhere.":[""],"Card":[""],"Layout":[""],"Columns":[""],"Color":[""],"Click":[""],"Hover":[""],"What to show":[""],"Open a panel on":[""],"Classic Accordion":[""],"Classic":[""],"A plain title bar. Opens to show the featured image beside the excerpt.":[""],"Compact List":[""],"Compact":[""],"Thumbnail, title and meta all in the bar. Opens to the excerpt underneath.":[""],"Cover Cards":[""],"Cover":[""],"The featured image is the card, with the title and meta over it.":[""],"Newest first":[""],"Recently updated":[""],"Title A\u2013Z":[""],"Menu order":[""],"Most commented":[""],"Random":[""],"Descending":[""],"Ascending":[""],"Choose a layout":[""],"You can change this later, and every colour and size stays adjustable.":[""],"Which posts":[""],"Post type":[""],"Posts":[""],"Order by":[""],"Direction":[""],"Limit to categories":[""],"Show at first":[""],"How many cards appear before Load More is pressed.":[""],"Fetch at most":[""],"Every post is printed into the page, so keep this to what the page really needs.":[""],"Featured image":[""],"Author":[""],"Category":[""],"Date":[""],"Reading time":[""],"Excerpt":[""],"Excerpt length (words)":[""],"Read More link":[""],"Read More text":[""],"Close button":[""],"Close button text":[""],"Hovering a card opens it, and it stays open when the pointer moves on. Clicking and the keyboard still work, which is what keeps the cards reachable on a phone.":[""],"A card opens when its title is clicked, or with Enter when it is focused.":[""],"Open the first card on load":[""],"Close the others when one opens":[""],"Load More button":[""],"Reveals the next batch. The posts are already on the page, so nothing is fetched.":[""],"Load More text":[""],"Gap between cards":[""],"Background when open":[""],"Toggle icon":[""],"Title":[""],"Color when open":[""],"Meta":[""],"Excerpt color":[""],"Excerpt typography":[""],"Cover photo":[""],"Image":[""],"Image width":[""],"Card height":[""],"Photo tint":[""],"Washes the photograph in a colour so the words on top of it read as one design rather than three different pictures. A part-transparent colour works best \u2014 the card already darkens towards the bottom on its own.":[""],"Category pill":[""],"Image radius":[""],"Load More & Close buttons":[""],"The Read More link follows the excerpt colour instead, so it always sits with the text it belongs to.":[""],"Cards open here just as they will on the page. Use the sidebar to change the layout, the posts and the styling.":[""]}}}